{
    "title": "Lock Apps - App Lock, Password",
    "description": "App Lock - Fingerprint & Applock can help you lock apps and hide Videos/Photos/Messages to protect your data with a single click. Safe your phone with the pattern or fingerprint. Prevent unauthorized access and easily guard your privacy.\r\n\r\nApp Lock can help you:\r\nLock all apps like WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat, Messenger, SMS, incoming calls,  Contacts, Gmail, Play Store and any app that you want to lock with your fingerprint.\r\n\r\n Lock videos & Lock pictures- Hidden videos & pictures can only be visible in the video vault and photo vault. Protects your private data easily. No one can see your private videos, photos, or messages without a password, pattern, or fingerprint.\r\n\r\nAppLock supports pattern lock & fingerprint lock. You can use multiple locks at a time Pattern & Fingerprint lock.\r\n\r\nCapture Intruder Picture - Take pictures of intruders who enter an incorrect password.\r\n\r\nSafe your private data easily. No password, no way.\r\n\r\nFeatures of Applock, Fingerprint: App Locker\r\nReal-Time Privacy Protection for mobile\r\n\r\nLock Payment Apps: Google Pay, PayPal, Payoneer, etc. No worry about your kids paying with credit cards without permission.\r\n\r\nLock Social Apps: WhatsApp, Facebook, Messenger, Snapchat, Gmail etc. No worries about parents check your social media apps!\r\n\r\nEncrypt private Videos/Pictures: Hide your private files, only visible in the photo vault & video vault.\r\n\r\n\r\nPrivacy Protection 100% FREE\r\n* Intruder Selfie: Capture photos of the intruders and notify you of any unauthorized access attempts in your phone!\r\n\r\n* Lock Apps Protection: Anyone cannot uninstall your app lock, don't worry about lock failure or misuse.\r\n\r\n* Multiple Locks: Random keyboard and pattern lock. Protect your private data with Pattern or Fingerprint.\r\n\r\nLATEST Protection Function:\r\n*Reset Password: When forget your password, you can reset it with a security question and fingerprint verification.\r\n\r\n*App Lock Turn Off: You can turn off the App Lock completely by app settings and turn off the App Lock with a single click.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14Best AppLock for your Android device:\r\nIf you are worried about parents checking your social media apps like Facebook, WhatsApp, Snapchat etc.\r\n\r\nAre you worried about someone looking at your data while borrowing your phone?\r\n\r\nAre you worried about private photos and videos when your phone is not around you?\r\n\r\nAre you worried about the kids sending the wrong messages and paying for games?\r\n\r\nYour privacy is our priority. Secure your apps with this locking app! App Lock is one of the best professional app locker with multiple lock options password lock, pattern lock & fingerprint lock. Now you can lock all your apps freely, download and have a try.\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0fRequired permission:\r\nAppLock needs All Files Access permission to help you hide your private photos/videos and other files. It's only used to protect files and will never be used for other purposes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "App Lock - Fingerprint &amp; Applock can help you lock apps and hide Videos/Photos/Messages to protect your data with a single click. Safe your phone with the pattern or fingerprint. Prevent unauthorized access and easily guard your privacy.<br><br>App Lock can help you:<br>Lock all apps like WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat, Messenger, SMS, incoming calls,  Contacts, Gmail, Play Store and any app that you want to lock with your fingerprint.<br><br> Lock videos &amp; Lock pictures- Hidden videos &amp; pictures can only be visible in the video vault and photo vault. Protects your private data easily. No one can see your private videos, photos, or messages without a password, pattern, or fingerprint.<br><br>AppLock supports pattern lock &amp; fingerprint lock. You can use multiple locks at a time Pattern &amp; Fingerprint lock.<br><br>Capture Intruder Picture - Take pictures of intruders who enter an incorrect password.<br><br>Safe your private data easily. No password, no way.<br><br>Features of Applock, Fingerprint: App Locker<br>Real-Time Privacy Protection for mobile<br><br>Lock Payment Apps: Google Pay, PayPal, Payoneer, etc. No worry about your kids paying with credit cards without permission.<br><br>Lock Social Apps: WhatsApp, Facebook, Messenger, Snapchat, Gmail etc. No worries about parents check your social media apps!<br><br>Encrypt private Videos/Pictures: Hide your private files, only visible in the photo vault &amp; video vault.<br><br><br>Privacy Protection 100% FREE<br>* Intruder Selfie: Capture photos of the intruders and notify you of any unauthorized access attempts in your phone!<br><br>* Lock Apps Protection: Anyone cannot uninstall your app lock, don&#39;t worry about lock failure or misuse.<br><br>* Multiple Locks: Random keyboard and pattern lock. Protect your private data with Pattern or Fingerprint.<br><br>LATEST Protection Function:<br>*Reset Password: When forget your password, you can reset it with a security question and fingerprint verification.<br><br>*App Lock Turn Off: You can turn off the App Lock completely by app settings and turn off the App Lock with a single click.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd14Best AppLock for your Android device:<br>If you are worried about parents checking your social media apps like Facebook, WhatsApp, Snapchat etc.<br><br>Are you worried about someone looking at your data while borrowing your phone?<br><br>Are you worried about private photos and videos when your phone is not around you?<br><br>Are you worried about the kids sending the wrong messages and paying for games?<br><br>Your privacy is our priority. Secure your apps with this locking app! App Lock is one of the best professional app locker with multiple lock options password lock, pattern lock &amp; fingerprint lock. Now you can lock all your apps freely, download and have a try.<br><br>\u2699\ufe0fRequired permission:<br>AppLock needs All Files Access permission to help you hide your private photos/videos and other files. It&#39;s only used to protect files and will never be used for other purposes.",
